          "question": "Consider the algebraic ring $\\mathbb{Z}_{28}$. 1. Determine the cardinality $|U(28)|$ of the group of units $U(28)$ using Euler's totient formula. 2. Verify whether $[11] \\in U(28)$, and if so, compute its multiplicative inverse $[11]^{-1} \\in \\mathbb{Z}_{28}$ using the Extended Euclidean Algorithm. 3. Solve the linear congruence $11x \\equiv 15 \\pmod{28}$.",
          "statement": "Consider the algebraic ring $\\mathbb{Z}_{28}$. 1. Determine the cardinality $|U(28)|$ of the group of units $U(28)$ using Euler's totient formula. 2. Verify whether $[11] \\in U(28)$, and if so, compute its multiplicative inverse $[11]^{-1} \\in \\mathbb{Z}_{28}$ using the Extended Euclidean Algorithm. 3. Solve the linear congruence $11x \\equiv 15 \\pmod{28}$.",
