          "question": "Consider the cyclic additive group $G = \\mathbb{Z}_{36}$. 1. List all positive divisors $d$ of 36 and write down the unique subgroup $H_d$ of order $d$ for each divisor. 2. How many generators does $\\mathbb{Z}_{36}$ have? List all of them explicitly. 3. Find the exact order of the element $[20] \\in \\mathbb{Z}_{36}$ and determine which subgroup it generates.",
          "statement": "Consider the cyclic additive group $G = \\mathbb{Z}_{36}$. 1. List all positive divisors $d$ of 36 and write down the unique subgroup $H_d$ of order $d$ for each divisor. 2. How many generators does $\\mathbb{Z}_{36}$ have? List all of them explicitly. 3. Find the exact order of the element $[20] \\in \\mathbb{Z}_{36}$ and determine which subgroup it generates.",
